基本上就是依照XY加文字進去

library(ggplot2)
ggplot(iris)+
  geom_point(aes(x=Sepal.Length,y=Sepal.Width,colour=Species))+
  geom_text(aes(x=Sepal.Length,y=Sepal.Width+0.1,label=Species))

 <https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-IH-7keVQRXs/WHDfFNQNXII/AAAAAAAA8ls/GxjKRPmLAcwjFbonU9L04IFcl8at2wq8gCLcB/s1600/a.png>

但是如果點相近就會重疊

可以嘗試套件ggrepel

library(ggrepel)
ggplot(iris)+
  geom_point(aes(x=Sepal.Length,y=Sepal.Width,colour=Species))+
